    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Real Estate theme offers a complete and professional solution for building real estate websites for agents, brokers, developers, property consultants, and real estate marketers, featuring One Click Demo Import for fast setup, fully responsive design, customizable banners, property listings, and easy property management tools, while WooCommerce support enables selling real estate guides, property reports, and digital marketing resources, Contact Form 7 ensures lead capture and client inquiries, and Yoast SEO enhances search visibility; perfect for showcasing residential, commercial, luxury properties, apartments, villas, plots, office spaces, retail leasing, or vacation rentals, this theme integrates seamlessly with Easy Property Listings and other popular plugins, supports real estate agencies, property dealers, consultants, and marketing firms, and provides SEO-optimized layouts, fast performance, and a clean design to boost lead generation, property branding, and conversions, giving your property portal, real estate marketplace, or investment platform a polished, high-performing, and user-friendly online presence."
    },
